# Terraform working files. The provider binary alone is ~650 MB and must never be committed --
# `terraform init` downloads it on demand. The .terraform.lock.hcl file IS committed, deliberately:
# it pins provider versions so `terraform validate` in CI checks the same code everyone else runs.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

